    "topic": "Collapse all questions",
    "questionText": "An automotive engineer employed by Motor Company designed the accelerator system for the Motor Company Car. Engineer designed and tested the Car\u2019s accelerator for Motor Company. Defects in the Car\u2019s accelerator system are now at issue in a federal court class action lawsuit filed by consumers harmed in accidents where the accelerator malfunctioned. May the consumers take Engineer\u2019s deposition?",
